          "For the best\nexperience, please\ndownload a release",
          "build of Don't Die\nby GreyMania.",
          "However, this\ndoesn't mean you\nhave an",
          "unauthorized ROM!\nGreyMania also\ndistributed",
          "beta ROMS of the\ngame for everyone\nto download!",
          "You may have just\nclicked the wrong\ndownload link!",
          "If you want to\nkeep this ROM, go\nright ahead.",
          "Beta ROMS of games\nare really cool to\nhave, and it's",
